{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Did I say something wrong? I'm sorry...\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T20:53:28.381000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867509609194455080","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Oh no no...it's just. It's all too fast. I'm not ready for something like that just yet. I still feel like there's a lot we don't yet know about each other that we will get by simply adventuring and spending time together before all that. I like you for real, I don't want it to just end up a fling\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T20:55:44.313000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867510179335241769","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"I don't want it to be just a fling either, Finn... I've never been in a relationship before... I don't know if I'm going to fast or too slow or what... but I know I want to be with you, Finn....\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T20:57:42.801000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T20:58:30.065000Z","id":"867510676309671957","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Just yourself. You don't need to wonder what others do and how you've seen others progress. I suppose if it does happen, it would be naturally\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T20:59:49.050000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867511205837144074","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"I don't know what I'm doing though... I've never felt about anyone how I feel about you before... I don't want to mess everything up... I'm scared to mess it up. The time you had to walk out from our date... I felt like nothing mattered anymore without you, and I broke down, I couldn't do anything... I didn't want to do anything anymore...\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T21:11:39.447000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867514185457205268","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"When you came back and asked me to dance... everything felt right again... but I'm still scared to lose you...\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T21:14:18.962000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867514854512394240","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"A relationship shouldn't be built on fear of losing the other, but on hope of building a future. The world has always been dire and dangerous every day of its existence, if we don't find the time to smile and throw away our worries then it's letting the world win.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T21:16:16.455000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867515347313623090","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"With or without me you still need to be your own person, have your own hopes and dreams and brave the world as it is. The cool thing about relationships is that you just have someone there to support you afterwards.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T21:17:20.701000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867515616780091423","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"And to build another dream with together\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T21:17:36.629000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867515683586703409","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Two plus two equals five and all that, yeah?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T21:17:52.646000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867515750767657020","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
